    },
    {
        "text": "He is immersed in his own battlefield."
    },
    {
        "text": "The enemies he faces are unspeakable, his tongue rigid and dead inside his mouth."
    },
    {
        "text": "The people he loved have already left, never to see the next spring."
    },
    {
        "text": "He lifts his weapon high into the air. All he feels is that he has something he must protect."
    },
    {
        "text": "But... what is it?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sound of a flute slowly drifts in."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Plays flute laboriously)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle! Uncle! I'm right here! Hurry! Don't stay in the forest!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get out of here together! Let's go home!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_hgmlgscrm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1244_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Howls)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eerie Fabric"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "You think I'm scared of you! Get lost, you ugly thing! Gun kai!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Urgh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_hammer",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1244_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_hgmdspr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "A long axe lodges itself in the chest of the strange monster. It struggles to get up, but at least, the silk strands fall apart and disperse onto the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "Long after the axe had been released, the lumberjack's hands remain fixed in the motion of throwing his weapon. Unable to see clearly, he lowers his head and turns his ears, carefully listening to the sounds around him."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There you are, Uncle! Finally found you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm over here! Hurry, come on over! I'll take you to safety!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The lumberjack continues to listen carefully, and looks toward Grain Buds."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_grass"
    },
    {
        "text": "He then picks up his axe again, and turns to head deeper into the woods."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle? Uncle! It's dangerous over there! You need to turn back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grain Buds brings her flute to her lips again, tries hard to steady her breathing, and begins to play another song."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_relaxflutem",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The flowers have bloomed, so hurry on home~\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen, listen, 'tis I who calls you back~\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, the lumberjack does not stop. Several monsters lie prone in the grass in front of Grain Buds."
    },
    {
        "text": "His cloudy eyes are unable to discern the things in front of him, the world spinning endlessly before his eyes. The blood in his veins roars, drowning out all other sound."
    },
    {
        "text": "Until a sharp cry pierces his ears like a needle."
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaagh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1243_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Lumberjack"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grain Buds turns to try to run, but then she raises her flute again, and a sharper sound reaches his ears."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_relaxflutem"
    },
    {
        "text": "The flowers have bloomed, so hurry on home~\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen, listen, 'tis I who calls you back~\u266a"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1243_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...The flowers have bloomed, and it's time to come home...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Lumberjack"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "100,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He takes a step forward."
    },
    {
        "text": "A tiny white finger is holding his hand."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1243_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Lumberjack"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle, let's go... You don't know how to get back, do you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't you want to go back? Are you afraid you'll scare the others?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "text": "I promise, nobody's going to be afraid of you anymore. They won't treat you like a freak... If anyone tries to badmouth you again, I'll bonk them on the head with my flute!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, let's go back together, okay...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The red silk tied to his arm suddenly loosens and is blown away by the wind, floating lazily into the sky."
    },
    {
        "text": "Large teardrops roll from the lumberjack's cloudy eyes, but Grain Buds does not notice."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1243_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Lumberjack"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1244_1#3$1",
        "posfrom": "500,0",
