        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many more... Is there really no end to these monsters?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "All we can do is try our best to block them here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How is it possible... to stop them from being afraid...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's ever seen a battle like this before...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "A vast field sprawls in front of him, countless terrifying-looking monsters continuing to sprout from the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "Behind those two, a large number of people queue up in a long line and march slowly toward the city's center."
    },
    {
        "text": "Cries erupt from the team. The Tumu Tianshis barely manage to erect a defensive line with their Originium Arts, standing between the people and the monsters."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$smallearthquake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 5,
        "vibrato": 50,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The ground beneath their feet shakes, and a few more cries burst from the crowd."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The plate was just disconnected from the core city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Control of the various soil parameters in the experimental plate depend on the core city's power supply... Now that it's been cut off, the field will become fallow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1249_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1250_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1250_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Xiao bie du zi! Where did these damned monsters come from? All our years of hard work, ruined because of you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Resentful Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never been wronged like this in all my years here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Resentful Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1249_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn right! Why the hell should we run from these?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "These beasts want to destroy our land and swallow up our crops, so we're gonna fight 'em to the very end!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, let's take the fight to them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful, everyone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone picks up a hoe left in the field, and turns to rush at an unknown monster. The hoe falls heavily upon the monster's head, causing the creature to stagger."
    },
    {
        "text": "The farmers desperately pick up whatever objects lie at their disposal, throwing stones and farm tools at the monster."
