        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, come on down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Old Tianshi'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your mind has already reached its limit. Stand down. I don't want to have to kill another apprentice with my own two hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Old Tianshi'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go back. There's a clever young lady waiting out there. We can't let her go without her parents.",
