        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been difficult for all of you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Old Tianshi'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I'd head back to Dahuang to recover from my injuries, but imagine running into something like this... You'd better hope I don't get my hands on you, needle prick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Old Tianshi'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The golden eccentric looks around and reaches for her belt."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's my fan...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Old Tianshi'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The strange fabric seems aware of the danger and hesitates, not daring to draw closer."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My sorry disciples even asked how I'm not scared of these things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Old Tianshi'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I flipped the question around: after killing so many of them, why are these things not afraid of me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Old Tianshi'"
    },
