    {
        "text": "A fowlbeast flies by."
    },
    {
        "text": "In a domain not meant for fowlbeasts. In this place, the sun, the moon, the stars, the wind, the frost, the rain, the snow, the mountains, the rivers\u2014none of it is meant to exist in the first place."
    },
    {
        "text": "But, this particular fowlbeast picks up an ear of rice, flaps its wings, and tarries on the peak of a hill."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
