        "channel": "c",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Its heart beats, and beats, as if something is about to burst out\u2013\u2013"
    },
    {
        "text": "A gust of wind blows by, causing the saplings to wobble."
    },
    {
        "text": "The rivers flow without cease, the water coursing."
    },
    {
        "text": "The mountains and rivers rise, the earth and soil rumbling."
    },
    {
        "text": "The trees plant their roots, their shadows swaying."
    },
    {
        "text": "As if sensing something, the fowlbeast takes flight once more with the ear of rice in its mouth, two seeds of rice falling into the boundless paddies."
    },
    {
        "text": "Swish, swoosh... swish, swoosh\u2013\u2013"
    },
    {
        "text": "A pair of eyes open."
    },
